    "body": "Fixes #39764.\n\n`STAGING_REQ` used to grow `chunk_staging_infos` to whatever `chunk_idx` arrived on the wire. Decode now rejects negative indices, non-positive page counts, and anything at or past the request's recorded page count (with a finite fallback cap if that span was never set). Mooncake and NIXL receivers record `_staging_total_pages` in `send_metadata`.\n\nUnit test covers the huge-index OOM path and an in-range alloc.\n\n## Checklist\n\n- [x] Format your code according to the [Format code with pre-commit](https://docs.sglang.io/developer_guide/contribution_guide.html#format-code-with-pre-commit).\n- [x] Add unit tests according to the [Run and add unit tests](https://docs.sglang.io/developer_guide/contribution_guide.html#run-and-add-unit-tests).\n- [ ] Update documentation according to [Write documentations](https://docs.sglang.io/developer_guide/contribution_guide.html#write-documentations).\n- [ ] Provide accuracy and speed benchmark results according to [Test the accuracy](https://docs.sglang.io/developer_guide/contribution_guide.html#test-the-accuracy) and [Benchmark the speed](https://docs.sglang.io/developer_guide/contribution_guide.html#benchmark-the-speed).\n- [x] Follow the SGLang code style [guidance](https://docs.sglang.io/developer_guide/contribution_guide.html#code-style-guidance).\n\n<!-- pr-states:start -->\n---\n### CI States\n\nLatest PR Test (Base): <!-- slot:pr-test:start -->:x: [Run #35085733472](https://github.com/sgl-project/sglang/actions/runs/35085733472)<!-- slot:pr-test:end -->\nLatest PR Test (Extra): <!-- slot:pr-test-extra:start -->:x: [Run #35085733378](https://github.com/sgl-project/sglang/actions/runs/35085733378)<!-- slot:pr-test-extra:end -->\nLatest PR Test (AMD ROCm 10): <!-- slot:pr-test-amd:start -->:x: [Run #35085733460](https://github.com/sgl-project/sglang/actions/runs/35085733460)<!-- slot:pr-test-amd:end -->\n<!-- pr-states:end -->",
